      "name": "Constrict",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>If the reefclaw has a creature Grabbed or Restrained, it can spend one action to crush them in its coils. The creature takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> bludgeoning damage depending on its DC 17 basic Fortitude save.</p></details>",
