      "description": "<p>A target that takes slashing damage from the reefclaw's claw Strike must succeed at a DC 17 Fortitude save or take <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> poison damage.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>Reefclaws are aquatic monsters that resemble huge shrimp or lobsters. Though reefclaws can't speak, they are intelligent enough to understand the local language of humanoids near their hunting grounds.</p>",
